# Generated 2026-11-27
# Base: seleron/vitabrowser (patch stack through 480)
#
# P2 (input on JS-heavy pages), shadow DOM unit 1: device run 43 -- taps on
# old.reddit.com's login options (<auth-flow-link>, whose click handler is
# on the <a> in its shadow root) did nothing. Patch 242's shadow root is a
# fragment the engine never draws, and the engine's event path is the light
# tree: an event from a host's light child went child -> host, never
# through the child's assigned <slot> and the slot's shadow ancestors (the
# DOM's composed path).
#
# 1. vita_polyfill.js: a relay on each shadow host. When an event from a
#    light descendant reaches the host, a copy is dispatched on the
#    assigned slot (named slot = the child's slot attribute, else the
#    default slot); it bubbles slot -> shadow ancestors -> shadow root,
#    and its preventDefault / stopPropagation carry back to the original.
#    Relays for the tap events (click, pointer/mouse down/up, touch
#    start/end) are added when attachShadow runs -- usually first in a
#    component's constructor, so they run before the host's own listeners,
#    as in a browser -- and any other type the first time an element in a
#    shadow tree listens for it. Nested components chain. attachShadow is
#    wrapped on every prototype in an element's chain that owns one, and
#    the returned root is remembered (closed roots too).
#
# 2. macsurf_qjs.c: el.dispatchEvent from inside a listener of a
#    script-dispatched event fired only that node's own listeners (the
#    g_qjs_in_dispatch guard) -- no bubbling. The listener callback has used
#    __msFireLocal for elements since fixes1008, so the native is reached
#    from page code only: a nested dispatch is now a real one, up to 16
#    deep (deeper falls back to local firing). Any web component that
#    re-dispatches a bubbling event from a click handler was affected. The
#    flag was also reset to 0 after a nested call instead of restored.
#    stopPropagation now leaves __msStopProp on the event, as
#    stopImmediatePropagation leaves __msStopNow, so the relay sees it.
#
# 3. interact.c: IN-shadow-taps.html (a component whose shadow <a> handler
#    navigates) and a tap on its slotted text that must reach
#    IN-target.html?via=shadow.
#
# Not here: events that START inside a shadow tree (not drawn yet),
# retargeting (inside the shadow the copy's target is the slot), custom
# elements created by innerHTML inside a shadow root are not upgraded.
# old.reddit's options also need lit to render (its classMap() template
# check fails in this engine, so <auth-flow-link>'s <a> holds no <slot>).
